# Software industry mapping for REL
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/rel/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:product_release owl:equivalentClass sw:ProductRelease .
legacy:product_release_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:productReleaseId .
legacy:releases_product_edition rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:releasesProductEdition .
